     "text": "The most disciplined people you know have the least willpower.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.5,
     "gains": [
      1.1
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "And that's exactly why they win.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.7
    },
    {
     "text": "Most of us think discipline means fighting temptation all day.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "Phone on the desk. Snacks in the kitchen. Notifications on.",
     "mode": "story",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "Every hour, a new fight.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "And every fight costs you a little more.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.7
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "b",
   "at": "auto",
   "gap": 0.8,
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "Disciplined people don't win those fights.",
     "mode": "normal",
     "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
     "text": "They remove them.",
     "mode": "quote",
     "pause": 0.9,
     "gains": [
      1.15
